DESCRIPTION:Colored Pencil with Nina Antze: 5/12/26\n\n  \n    \n      \n 
        \n          $45.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nTuesday\, May 12\
 , 2026\; 10 AM - 1 PM3 HR CLASS - $45Located in the Dining Room at SebArts
 These workshops are geared to the advanced\, ongoing students who want in-
 person instruction and feedback on their colored pencil projects. Please c
 onsult the instructor before signing up\, Nina Antze antze@pcquilt.comNina
  Antze is a botanical artist\, quilt maker and teacher living in Sonoma Co
 unty. She has a degree in Fine Art from San Francisco State University and
  has a Certificate in Botanical Illustration from the New York Botanical G
 ardens. Her paintings are part of the Filoli Florilegium and the Alcatraz 
